    description: "PR-3 of the inherited_calls campaign (parent META INV-nilud). Add `_walk_single_then_interfaces` walker to `linkers/inherited_calls.py`. Switch Java bare/`this` calls (`java.py:1437-1461`) to `make_unresolved_edge(..., enclosing_class=<owner>)`. Delete the Site-1 walk from `java.py`. Migrate `TestJavaInheritedMethodResolution` (`test_java.py:4303-4374`) to pipeline-mode.\n\n**Edge confidence preserved.** `ast_call_inherited` at 0.90.\n\n**Bakeoff cohort:** spring-petclinic, spring-boot, chatwoot.\n\n**Success criterion:** `ast_call_inherited` edges within ±1 on spring-petclinic; chatwoot unchanged (no Java effect).\n\n**Tag at merge:** `awaits_bakeoff_validation`.\n\nCanonical plan: `~/puluf-plan.md`."  # 359c
